# Tamil in Living Form!

A form of Tamil itself! Annamalai University offered its tribute of affection to Navalar Somasundara Bharathiar by draping him in a golden shawl on 28 February. People know that this great Tamil scholar was recently awarded the honorary title of "Doctor."

This is a sign of the people's awakening to honour and celebrate symbols of Tamil. By honouring this great man, the university has honoured Tamil and the Tamil awakening, thereby increasing its own distinction. We praise those responsible for this feeling and wish their enthusiasm to grow.

The students of Annamalainagar are said to have been immersed in joy at seeing "Tamil" honoured. The country too delights upon seeing the news. We also rejoice. Long live Navalar! Long may he live!

(*Seithi*, 18-2-22; *Dravida Nadu*)
